    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n22 Berwick Hall is a spacious and well-presented three-bedroom townhouse ideally situated within this mature and highly sought-after residential development in the heart of Churchtown. Offering generous living accommodation, well-proportioned bedrooms and a bright conservatory overlooking the rear garden, this attractive home is sure to appeal to first-time buyers, growing families and those seeking a convenient South Dublin address.\n\nThe accommodation extends to approximately 108.6 sq. m. / 1,169 sq. ft. and briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hallway. To the front is a bright and spacious kitchen/dining room featuring a bay window and fitted with a range of floor and wall-mounted units together with integrated appliances. To the rear lies an exceptionally large living room with feature fireplace, providing an ideal space for both everyday living and entertaining guests. A bright conservatory overlooking the rear garden and a guest w.c. complete the ground floor accommodation.\n\nUpstairs there are three well-proportioned bedrooms, all benefiting from fitted wardrobes, with the principal bedroom further enhanced by an en-suite shower room. A fully tiled family bathroom and hot press off the landing complete the first-floor accommodation.\n\nBerwick Hall is a well-established development ideally located just off Whitehall Road, with a wealth of amenities within easy reach. Nutgrove Shopping Centre is within walking distance, while Dundrum Town Centre, Churchtown Village and a wide selection of shops, cafés and restaurants are all close by. The area is also well served by an excellent choice of primary and secondary schools, together with numerous public transport links and easy access to the M50.\n\nThis is an excellent opportunity to acquire a spacious family home in one of South Dublin's most convenient and sought-after residential locations."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hallway - 4.94m x 1.85m\nSpacious entrance hallway with carpet flooring, radiator and light fixture.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 4.94m x 3.28m\nBright and spacious kitchen/dining room with bay window, laminate flooring, radiator and tiled splashback. Fitted with a Belling electric oven, Belling electric hob, extractor hood, FlexiFresh fridge freezer, Hotpoint washing machine and sink.\n\nGuest WC - 1.67m x 1.84m\nLaminate flooring, wash hand basin and w.c., partially tiled\n\nLiving Room - 4.17m x 5.01m\nBright and exceptionally spacious reception room, ideal for entertaining, with carpet flooring, feature fireplace, two radiators and light fixture.\n\nConservatory - 1.92m x 2.36m\nBright conservatory with PVC surround and windows overlooking the rear garden.\n\nLanding - 3.44m x 1.98m\nCarpet flooring with hot press off.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.06m x 5.01m\nLarge double bedroom with fitted wardrobes, fitted bed surround, radiator and light fixture.\n\nEn-Suite - 0.85m x 2.93m\nElectric shower, wash hand basin, laminate flooring and radiator.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.66m x 2.44m\nCarpet flooring, fitted wardrobes, radiator and light fixture.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.54m x 2.47m\nFitted wardrobes, radiator and light fixture.\n\nBathroom - 1.34m x 2.93m\nFully tiled bathroom comprising bath, wash hand basin, mirrored vanity unit, w.c. and radiator.\n\n"
      },
